# FieldShift runs with zero API keys. Everything below is optional.

# NASA Earthdata login token (https://urs.earthdata.nasa.gov > Generate Token).
# Needed only for the SMAP soil moisture, GPM IMERG rainfall and Landsat/MODIS NDVI sources.
# Without it those three show "Needs Earthdata token". In Milestone 1 a valid token is only
# checked (against NASA CMR) and the sources report "coming in a later milestone"; no values are fetched yet.
# Server-side only: never prefix it with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
EARTHDATA_TOKEN=
